  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Cups clinking on each other is a network event that repeats 80 times in an instance of 80 people and causes network suffering.\n\n1. Join an instance of 80 people.\n\n2. Have two or more people spawn A Hot Cup of Generosity acquired from the 2026 seasonal event.\n\n3. Clink clink cups together, watch the cup collisions and audio behave weirdly (repeated collision sounds or audio cutting out) and the debug UI to report network suffering.\n\n4. Stop clinking. The suffering goes back down to 0.",
